### ============================================================================
### GUION DE LA DEMO · Nearby (Zona 3 · Las Flores, San Juan de Lurigancho)
### Base recién creada: ./mvnw spring-boot:test-run   (o docker compose -f compose.prod.yaml up con prod,demo)
### Ejecuta las peticiones en orden (IntelliJ HTTP Client o VS Code REST Client).
### ============================================================================
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1) LOGIN · María Quispe (vecina). En dev el código siempre es 123456.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "987654321" }

###
# @name maria
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "987654321", "code": "123456" }

### Brigada Z3
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "999000111" }

###
# @name brigada
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "999000111", "code": "123456" }

### Municipalidad SJL (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "999000000" }

###
# @name admin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "999000000", "code": "123456" }

### 2) SOS · María pide ayuda (avisa a vecinos a 500 m, brigada y 3 contactos; trae el código SMS)
# @name sos
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "d3a0d3a0-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "lat": -11.9790, "lng": -77.0030, "type": "HEALTH" }

### 3) MODO EMERGENCIA · la Municipalidad lo activa (el plan de rescate de la IA se genera solo)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/zones/{{maria.response.body.user.zone.id}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "EMERGENCY", "reason": "Sismo de magnitud 6.8" }

### María ve el modo emergencia en su app
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4) PLAN DE RESCATE IA (Protocolo Lázaro): 2 reportes preventivos, Jorge y Pedro para la Sra. Teresa
# @name plan
POST {{base}}/api/v1/ai/rescue-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{brigada.response.body.accessToken}}

### Tablero humanitario (la brigada ve direcciones exactas)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/vulnerable-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{brigada.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5) SMS DECODE · el brigadista lee un SOS enviado sin internet
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sms/decode
Authorization: Bearer {{brigada.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "NB#SOS!H1@LP340$P:ALTA" }

### ... y la pasarela SMS lo convierte en reporte
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sms/inbound
X-Nearby-Token: dev-sms-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "+51956000447", "body": "NB#SOS!A2@MC12$P:ALTA" }

### María está a salvo
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sos/{{sos.response.body.id}}/safe
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6) MODO PREVENCIÓN · alerta por lluvias (El Niño)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/zones/{{maria.response.body.user.zone.id}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "PREVENTION", "reason": "Aviso SENAMHI por lluvias intensas", "weatherLevel": "ORANGE" }

### Radar: Quebrada Canto Grande en ROJO y Jr. Los Pinos en ÁMBAR
POST {{base}}/api/v1/risk-zones/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7) REPORTE ESCALADO · el tercer reporte sube Jr. Los Pinos a ROJO (escalated = true)
# @name riesgo
POST {{base}}/api/v1/risk-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "d3a0d3a0-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "category": "SEEPAGE", "text": "Está brotando agua por la pared de la sala", "addressText": "Jr. Los Pinos 330" }

### 8) COORDINAR · "Sí, coordinar ayuda" con la Familia Ríos (sacos de arena y motobomba)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/risk-zones/{{riesgo.response.body.riskZone.id}}/coordinate
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}

### Mapa de calor
GET {{base}}/api/v1/map/heat
Authorization: Bearer {{maria.response.body.accessToken}}
